<title>USA: PHLX to list DT Industries options.</title>
<headline>PHLX to list DT Industries options.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philadelphia Stock Exchange said Thursday it will list options on DT Industries Inc on July 9.</p>
<p>It said the listing may be delayed by two days if the issue becomes dually-listed.</p>
<p>DT Industries options will open with strike prices of 30, 35 and 40 and expirations in August, September, December and March. Position limits have been set at 4,500 contracts.,</p>
<p>The PHLX said Penn Options Co will be the specialist unit.</p>
<p>((--Chicago derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
